#: man-kcookiejar4.8.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show version information"
msgstr "Mostra información da versión"

#. Tag: title
#: man-kcookiejar4.8.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid "Application Options"
msgstr "Opcións do aplicativo"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kcookiejar4.8.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "--shutdown"
msgstr "--shutdown"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kcookiejar4.8.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shut down cookie jar and the D-BUS service."
msgstr "Apaga o tarro de galletas e o servizo D-BUS."

#. Tag: term
#: man-kcookiejar4.8.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>--remove</option> <parameter>domain</parameter>"
msgstr "<option>--remove</option> <parameter>dominio</parameter>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kcookiejar4.8.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removes cookies for <parameter>domain</parameter> from the cookie jar."
msgstr "Retira todas as cookies de <parameter>dominio</parameter> do almacén."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kcookiejar4.8.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid "--remove-all"
msgstr "--remove-all"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kcookiejar4.8.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removes all the cookies from the cookie jar."
msgstr "Retira todas as cookies no almacén."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kcookiejar4.8.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid "--reaload-config"
msgstr "--reaload-config"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kcookiejar4.8.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reloads the configuration file."
msgstr "Carga de novo o ficheiro de configuración."

#. Tag: title
#: man-kcookiejar4.8.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Utilización"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kcookiejar4.8.docbook:170
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"KDE web browser <command>konqueror</command> uses <command>kcookiejar4</"
"command> for storing and managing cookies using the D-Bus service "
"<command>kcookiejar4</command> provides."
msgstr ""
"O navegador web de KDE, <command>konqueror</command> usa "
"<command>kcookiejar4</command> para gardar e xestionar as cookies usando o "
"servizo web que este fornece."

#. Tag: para
#: man-kcookiejar4.8.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When <command>kcookiejar4</command> is started without parameters, it "
"provides a D-BUS service to handle HTTP cookies."
msgstr ""
"Cando <command>kcookiejar4</command> se arranca sen parámetros, fornece un "
"servizo D-BUS para xestionar as cookies HTTP."

#. Tag: para
#: man-kcookiejar4.8.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When <command>kcookiejar4</command> is started with some parameters, it does "
"additional tasks to the cookies jar it provides, like removing the cookies "
"from one <parameter>domain</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"Cando <command>kcookiejar4</command> se arranca con algún parámetro, fai "
"traballos adicionais nos almacéns que fornece, como retirar as cookies dun "
"<parameter>dominio</parameter>."

